/A 1453 0 R
/Alt (Panel A shows a UMAP scatter plot of immune cell clusters labeled by color. Panel B displays a similar UMAP labeled by cell type identities. Panel C is a dot plot summarizing marker gene expression for each immune cell type, with dot size indicating fraction of cells expressing and color intensity reflecting mean expression. Panel D presents a vertical bar chart of cell counts for each immune subset. Panel E shows another dimensional reduction plot highlighting B cells, NK cells, macrophages, pDC, and cDC1 cells. Panel F is a bar chart comparing counts of two B cell subsets defined by CYBB gene expression status. Panel G is a volcano plot showing differential gene expression between B cell subgroups by CYBB detection. Panel H is a horizontal bar chart depicting enriched pathways, with bars colored by significance. Panel I shows a scatter plot illustrating the correlation between CYBB and BCL2 gene expression, with correlation coefficient and p value noted.)
/K [11 1454 0 R]
/P 160 0 R
/Pg 51 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (FIGURE 3)
